msgid "Change Terminal Title"
msgstr "Ubah judul terminal"

msgid "Leave blank to restore the default title."
msgstr "Biarkan kosong untuk mengembalikan judul bawaan."

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

msgid "Configuration Errors"
msgstr "Kesalahan konfigurasi"

msgid ""
"One or more configuration errors were found. Please review the errors below, "
"and either reload your configuration or ignore these errors."
msgstr ""
"Ditemukan satu atau lebih kesalahan konfigurasi. Silakan tinjau kesalahan di "
"bawah ini, dan muat ulang konfigurasi anda atau abaikan kesalahan ini."

msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Abaikan"

msgid "Reload Configuration"
msgstr "Muat ulang konfigurasi"

msgid "Split Up"
msgstr "Belah atas"

msgid "Split Down"
msgstr "Belah bawah"

msgid "Split Left"
msgstr "Belah kiri"

msgid "Split Right"
msgstr "Belah kanan"

msgid "Execute a command…"
msgstr "Eksekusi perintah…"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Salin"

msgid "Paste"
msgstr "Tempel"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Bersihkan"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Atur ulang"

msgid "Split"
msgstr "Belah"

msgid "Change Title…"
msgstr "Ubah judul…"

msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Tab"

msgid "New Tab"
msgstr "Tab baru"

msgid "Close Tab"
msgstr "Tutup tab"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "Jendela"

msgid "New Window"
msgstr "Jendela baru"

msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Tutup jendela"

msgid "Config"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

msgid "Open Configuration"
msgstr "Buka konfigurasi"

msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "Palet perintah"

msgid "Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "Inspektur terminal"

msgid "About Witty"
msgstr "Tentang Witty"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Keluar"

msgid "Authorize Clipboard Access"
msgstr "Mengesahkan akses papan klip"

msgid ""
"An application is attempting to read from the clipboard. The current "
"clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi sedang mencoba membaca dari papan klip. Isi papan klip saat ini "
"ditampilkan di bawah ini."

msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Tolak"

msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Izinkan"

msgid "Remember choice for this split"
msgstr "Ingat pilihan untuk belahan ini"

msgid "Reload configuration to show this prompt again"
msgstr "Muat ulang konfigurasi untuk menampilkan pesan ini lagi"

msgid ""
"An application is attempting to write to the clipboard. The current "
"clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi sedang mencoba menulis ke papan klip. Isi papan klip saat ini "
"ditampilkan di bawah ini."

msgid "Warning: Potentially Unsafe Paste"
msgstr "Peringatan: Tempelan berpotensi tidak aman"

msgid ""
"Pasting this text into the terminal may be dangerous as it looks like some "
"commands may be executed."
msgstr ""
"Menempelkan teks ini ke terminal mungkin berbahaya karena sepertinya "
"beberapa perintah mungkin dijalankan."

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

msgid "Quit Witty?"
msgstr "Keluar dari Witty?"

msgid "Close Window?"
msgstr "Tutup jendela?"

msgid "Close Tab?"
msgstr "Tutup tab?"

msgid "Close Split?"
msgstr "Tutup belahan?"

msgid "All terminal sessions will be terminated."
msgstr "Semua sesi terminal akan diakhiri."

msgid "All terminal sessions in this window will be terminated."
msgstr "Semua sesi terminal di jendela ini akan diakhiri."

msgid "All terminal sessions in this tab will be terminated."
msgstr "Semua sesi terminal di tab ini akan diakhiri."

msgid "The currently running process in this split will be terminated."
msgstr "Proses yang sedang berjalan dalam belahan ini akan diakhiri."

msgid "Copied to clipboard"
msgstr "Disalin ke papan klip"

msgid "Cleared clipboard"
msgstr "Papan klip dibersihkan"

msgid "Command Succeeded"
msgstr "Perintah berhasil"

msgid "Command Failed"
msgstr "Perintah gagal"

msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "Menu utama"

msgid "View Open Tabs"
msgstr "Lihat tab terbuka"

msgid "New Split"
msgstr "Belahan baru"

msgid ""
"⚠️ You're running a debug build of Witty! Performance will be degraded."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ Anda sedang menjalankan versi debug dari Witty! Performa akan menurun."

msgid "Reloaded the configuration"
msgstr "Memuat ulang konfigurasi"

msgid "Witty Developers"
msgstr "Pengembang Witty"

msgid "Witty: Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "Witty: Inspektur terminal"
